      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm doing some research for a divinity paper on how different religious groups are responding to new laws about medical aid in dying (MAID) and end-of-life care. can u give me a summary of the main moral arguments used by religious conservatives vs religious liberals on this? i need to understand the core logic of both sides for my literature review.",
